      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_con_00_01",
      "hash64": "79E59B9EB0672DF2",
      "text": "No",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_01",
      "hash64": "4B3DD23D885F6D3A",
      "text": "¡Bienvenid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa! ¿Te apetece echar una partidilla\\nal Juego del Cazaogros?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_02",
      "hash64": "4B3DD13D885F6B87",
      "text": "¡Pues venga, a cazar todos los ogros que puedas!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_03",
      "hash64": "4B3DD03D885F69D4",
      "text": "¡Hasta otra!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_04",
      "hash64": "4B3DCF3D885F6821",
      "text": "¡Enhorabuena, has superado el nivel fácil!\\nToma, un premio por ser la primera vez.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_05",
      "hash64": "4B3DCE3D885F666E",
      "text": "Creo que estás list[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa para probar el nivel normal.\\n¡Si te atreves, claro!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_06",
      "hash64": "4B3DCD3D885F64BB",
      "text": "¡Has superado el nivel normal! Ya sabía yo.\\nToma, un premio por ser la primera vez.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_07",
      "hash64": "4B3DCC3D885F6308",
      "text": "Algo me dice que ya estás list[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa para probar\\nsuerte en el nivel difícil.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08",
      "hash64": "4B3DCB3D885F6155",
      "text": "¡Enhorabuena por superar el nivel difícil!\\nMuy pocos participantes llegan tan lejos.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_2",
      "hash64": "925FF7862C6613A4",
      "text": "Creo que puedo confiarte a cierto Pokémon...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_3",
      "hash64": "925FF8862C661557",
      "text": "Verás, hay un Munchlax que siempre se intenta\\nacoplar cuando ve gente disfrutando del Juego\\r\\ndel Cazaogros.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_4",
      "hash64": "925FF5862C66103E",
      "text": "Es un glotón de cuidado, así que no hace más\\nque dificultar el juego a los participantes.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_5",
      "hash64": "925FF6862C6611F1",
      "text": "¡Pero creo que tú podrás cuidar de él sin\\nproblema!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_6",
      "hash64": "925FF3862C660CD8",
      "text": "¡Te han entregado un Munchlax!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_09",
      "hash64": "4B3DCA3D885F5FA2",
      "text": "Oye, ¡pero si tienes todas las cajas llenas!\\nHaz algo de espacio para que te lo pueda dar.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_10",
      "hash64": "4B3A4D3D885C5564",
      "text": "Jugar",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_11",
      "hash64": "4B3A4E3D885C5717",
      "text": "¿Y mi Munchlax?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_12",
      "hash64": "4B3A4F3D885C58CA",
      "text": "¡Aquí lo tienes! Ahora sí que te puedo confiar\\na este pequeño glotón.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
